menu "ARD HMI"

    config HMI_DEFAULT_SERVER
        string "Default PC server host"
        default "192.168.0.35"
        help
            IPv4, DNS name or name.local of the PC running the ARD server (port 5000).
            Used until a server is saved on the board's /network settings page.

    config HMI_STATUS_POLL_MS
        int "Status poll interval (ms)"
        range 500 30000
        default 3000

    config HMI_LCD_INVERT
        bool "Invert panel colours (INVON)"
        default y
        help
            The ESP32-2432S028 ILI9341 panel needs inversion; the Arduino build
            called tft.invertDisplay(true).

    config HMI_Z_STEP_BUTTONS
        bool "Enable OpenLoop Z step +/- buttons"
        default n
        help
            The PC server forwards "mzs+N" to DriveMCU, and DriveMCU treats any
            "mzs<value>" as a new Z steps/mm calibration. Leave this off until the
            server stops forwarding the step command.

    config HMI_RAIL_PID
        bool "Enable ToF rail PID buttons (PID on/off, target)"
        default n
        help
            ToF-based Z rail PID control is locked for now. When off, the Z Rail
            page shows ToF and the current mode read-only and keeps only HOME.

endmenu
